    {
      "id": "claim_16aacc481c294083a72144e4bd9e9e4e",
      "statement": "The code-task submission-to-grade flow is: reassemble full source from editable+locked segments, re-validate locked segments verbatim (regions.ts), statically validate imports/FQN/ban-list (imports.ts), and only if clean postMessage to the sandboxed iframe; CheerpJ compiles and runs a generated KataRunner harness in a Worker, the RunResult is relayed to the main thread, and verify.ts compares it against the kata's Check[] to render pass/fail.",
