    {
      "id": "claim_25f6e383ad0c4f6aa854756967e48aab",
      "statement": "The import/FQN validator (imports.ts) strips comments and string/char/text-block literals, checks every import against the kata's allowedImports whitelist, scans for fully-qualified-name bypasses, and enforces a hard ban list (reflection, ClassLoader, Runtime/ProcessBuilder, System.exit, Unsafe, ad hoc Thread/Executors, java.io, java.net, etc.) that no whitelist can lift; only source passing both checks is sent to the sandbox.",
