      "id": "claim_919f76ab628a477cb4ebd48737643747",
      "statement": "The sandbox iframe is always torn down and rebuilt per run with no CheerpJ session reuse: finish() always calls teardownIframe() (removing it from the DOM) after any outcome (ok, error, timeout, stopped), and a fresh iframe is created lazily on the next run, avoiding a stale Main/KataRunner class being served from a previous run under the same class names.",
