      "id": "claim_1d96cf83042b424197cf678d840cf2ea",
      "statement": "The sandbox iframe (public/sandbox.html loading sandbox.js) is a thin relay with sandbox=allow-scripts allow-same-origin: on a run message it creates a Worker (sandbox-worker.js), forwards the run request, owns the run timeout (armed when the worker reports phase running), and on finish/result/timeout/stop terminates the Worker and relays the result to the parent; it accepts messages only from window.parent and runs one run at a time.",
