      "id": "claim_85d6bc2050804e15a82ccf958d35ff49",
      "statement": "sandbox-worker.js does all CheerpJ work in the Worker: it importScripts the CheerpJ 4.3 loader, intercepts console.log/error/warn/info to capture output, writes the user source and generated harness to the virtual FS via cheerpOSAddStringFile/cheerpjAddStringFile under /str/, compiles with cheerpjRunMain(\"com.sun.tools.javac.Main\", ...) against classpath /app/tools.jar:/files/ with -d /files/, then runs the KataRunner harness and parses sentinel-delimited stdout and ___KATA_RET___ return lines into a RunResult.",
