      "statement": "The postMessage protocol (protocol.ts) defines HostMessage = RunRequestMessage | StopMessage (run carries source, mainClass, checks, timeoutMs, and the generated harnessSource) and SandboxMessage = PhaseMessage | ResultMessage, with Phase in {loading, compiling, running} and RunResult variants ok/compile-error/runtime-error/error/timeout/stopped.",
