    {
      "id": "claim_f5500a37e0444f72b7507a8840b8350a",
      "statement": "The runner generates a KataRunner.java harness from the kata's Check[] per run (src/runner/harness.ts), handed to the sandbox as harnessSource in the run message; for stdout checks the harness redirects System.out to capture Main.main output, and for return checks it emits statically-typed direct calls per case with args/expected code-generated as Java literals, printing results between sentinel markers that the worker parses back out.",
